5. Certification Process

IASME outlines a structured assessment journey. Organisations must register, make payment, receive login access to the online portal, complete the assessment, obtain senior sign-off, and submit the answers for independent marking. Where feedback is issued, the organisation is given two working days to respond and resubmit. Once certification is achieved, the organisation receives a certificate and is listed on the public directory. Certification must then be renewed annually.

